# The Bluetooth PIN: a fresh device picks a random one once and keeps it, and a new random one
# at every boot is a choice; each is kept across a restart.
# both-modes
expect pinmode fixed
pref pin random
expect pinmode random
reboot
wait 3000
expect pinmode random
pref pin fixed
expect pinmode fixed
reboot
wait 3000
expect pinmode fixed
pref pin random
reboot
wait 3000
expect pinmode random
